@startuml 方案B异步提交时序
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam ArrowColor #5A5A5A
skinparam ArrowFontColor #333333
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
skinparam SequenceParticipantBorderColor #7A93BE
skinparam SequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #DCE9FB
skinparam SequenceParticipantFontColor #1F2933
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #7A93BE
skinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor #F7F9FC
skinparam SequenceGroupBorderColor #7A93BE
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFFBE6
skinparam NoteBorderColor #E0B400
skinparam NoteFontColor #5C4A00

title 方案 B：分析任务异步提交 —— 内网永不阻塞，429 重试隔离在外网

participant "Claude Code\n(内网决策)" as CC
participant "MCP Server\n(内网)" as MCP
participant "HGFS 队列" as Q
participant "analyst-bridge\n(外网常驻)" as AB
participant "外网 claudecode\n(只读分析员)" as OC
participant "设备 A\n(日志)" as D

== 一、异步提交(立即返回) ==

CC -> MCP : submit_analysis_task(question, context, allowed_cmds, acceptance)
MCP -> Q : 写 pending/analysis_<id>.json
MCP --> CC : 返回 { task_id, status:'accepted' }（立即返回）
note over CC : 内网这一轮 MCP 调用立刻结束\n不再阻塞等待，可继续干别的事

== 二、分析桥消费 ==

AB -> Q : 轮询 pending → 读到 kind='analysis' 任务
AB -> Q : 创建 .lock 抢占
AB -> AB : 拼 prompt = 系统只读指令 + memory/<device>.md + question + context

== 三、调外网 claudecode 分析(含 429 退避) ==

loop 429 重试预算内(最多 3 次 / 5 分钟)
  AB -> OC : SDK query() / claude -p 只读分析
  OC -> D : 执行只读命令(journalctl/tail/cat/grep...)
  D --> OC : 原始日志(剪裁后的样本)
  OC --> AB : 分析结论 + 证据片段
  alt 遇 429
    AB -> AB : retry-after 或指数退避(5s→10s→20s) + jitter
  end
end

== 四、回写结论 ==

AB -> Q : 写 completed/analysis_<id>.json(answer/summary/evidence)
alt 超预算/失败
  AB -> Q : 写 failed(error_code=rate_limited/analyst_timeout)
end

== 五、内网取回(定时轮询) ==

loop 内网按需轮询(低优先级背景)
  CC -> MCP : query_task_status(task_id) / analysis_status
  MCP -> Q : 轮询 completed/ 或 failed/
  Q --> MCP : 分析结论
  MCP --> CC : answer + evidence
end

== 六、记忆沉淀(可选叠加) ==

MCP -> MCP : 将结论摘要 append 进 memory/<device>.md
note over MCP : 下次分析从背景知识起步，减少重复推理

@enduml
